  "nonretroactivity": "This overlay does not change host sampling floors, literature-witness floors, frame rules, control pool rules, support breadth ceiling, shuffled-null rules, or any v5/v6 endpoint. It only separates a response-blind architecture-capability check from the later KIM001-specific adequate-set check so that pre-occurrence code need not inspect outcome-bearing adequacy metrics."
